{"kind":"assert","text":"Note to the builder on landing subjects.\n\nTwo merges this week carry a whole paragraph as the commit subject:\n9e313eff (771 characters) and 2be6ca74 (478 characters). The first\nline of the `gs merge --text` value becomes the commit subject. Keep\nthat first line under 100 code points, follow it with a blank line,\nand put the paragraph after it, as 41da9810 and 14ffb0f6 do. The\ncheck-commit-messages script flags the long ones; the landed commits\nstay as they are.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}